  "sentence_placements": [
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-01",
      "text": "Who can answer a question about the unconfirmed facilitator?",
      "source_start": 0.171,
      "source_end": 3.456,
      "sequence_start": 12.331,
      "sequence_end": 15.616
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-01",
      "text": "If the answer lives only in Morgan's head, our carefully designed pieces still do not make an operating system.",
      "source_start": 3.712,
      "source_end": 9.408,
      "sequence_start": 15.872,
      "sequence_end": 21.567999999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-01",
      "text": "We need one page that shows how the work travels.",
      "source_start": 9.685,
      "source_end": 12.432,
      "sequence_start": 21.845,
      "sequence_end": 24.592
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "Start with the real sequence on paper.",
      "source_start": 12.619,
      "source_end": 14.454,
      "sequence_start": 24.779,
      "sequence_end": 26.614
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "A request to compare a free digital-skills session enters.",
      "source_start": 14.71,
      "source_end": 18.081,
      "sequence_start": 26.87,
      "sequence_end": 30.241
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "A routing rule assigns the evidence-comparison role.",
      "source_start": 18.294,
      "source_end": 21.302,
      "sequence_start": 30.454,
      "sequence_end": 33.462
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "That role reads the three Harbor course notes and prepares a draft.",
      "source_start": 21.622,
      "source_end": 25.194,
      "sequence_start": 33.782,
      "sequence_end": 37.354
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "The draft and its short trace wait for Morgan.",
      "source_start": 25.48,
      "source_end": 28.275,
      "sequence_start": 37.64,
      "sequence_end": 40.435
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "Morgan may propose the option to the team, ask for another date, or hold it.",
      "source_start": 28.638,
      "source_end": 33.032,
      "sequence_start": 40.798,
      "sequence_end": 45.19199999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "The agent has no route to announce, book, buy, or send anything.",
      "source_start": 33.331,
      "source_end": 37.487,
      "sequence_start": 45.491,
      "sequence_end": 49.647000000000006
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "Draw that sequence before adding another box.",
      "source_start": 37.888,
      "source_end": 40.299,
      "sequence_start": 50.048,
      "sequence_end": 52.459
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Chapter Eight gives the operating map five columns.",
      "source_start": 40.662,
      "source_end": 43.606,
      "sequence_start": 52.822,
      "sequence_end": 55.766000000000005
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Trigger: what actually starts this row?",
      "source_start": 43.819,
      "source_end": 46.187,
      "sequence_start": 55.979,
      "sequence_end": 58.346999999999994
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Role: who owns this step?",
      "source_start": 46.464,
      "source_end": 48.384,
      "sequence_start": 58.623999999999995,
      "sequence_end": 60.544
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Tier: what may that role do?",
      "source_start": 48.683,
      "source_end": 50.589,
      "sequence_start": 60.843,
      "sequence_end": 62.748999999999995
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Handoff: who receives the work next, including a refusal?",
      "source_start": 50.873,
      "source_end": 54.585,
      "sequence_start": 63.033,
      "sequence_end": 66.745
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Evidence: where can a human find the record?",
      "source_start": 54.884,
      "source_end": 57.38,
      "sequence_start": 67.044,
      "sequence_end": 69.54
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "A blank is useful.",
      "source_start": 57.657,
      "source_end": 58.831,
      "sequence_start": 69.817,
      "sequence_end": 70.991
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "If you cannot name the evidence location, write 'missing.'",
      "source_start": 59.023,
      "source_end": 62.249,
      "sequence_start": 71.183,
      "sequence_end": 74.409
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "A tidy imaginary location would hide the work you still need to design.",
      "source_start": 62.496,
      "source_end": 66.144,
      "sequence_start": 74.656,
      "sequence_end": 78.304
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "Put the earlier lessons onto those rows.",
      "source_start": 66.422,
      "source_end": 68.662,
      "sequence_start": 78.582,
      "sequence_end": 80.822
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The job sits at the preparation step.",
      "source_start": 69.067,
      "source_end": 71.264,
      "sequence_start": 81.22699999999999,
      "sequence_end": 83.42399999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The Decision Card sits with Morgan.",
      "source_start": 71.456,
      "source_end": 73.291,
      "sequence_start": 83.616,
      "sequence_end": 85.451
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "Source IDs and expiry checks sit at intake.",
      "source_start": 73.59,
      "source_end": 76.65,
      "sequence_start": 85.75,
      "sequence_end": 88.81
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The receipt and trace travel with the brief.",
      "source_start": 76.936,
      "source_end": 79.24,
      "sequence_start": 89.096,
      "sequence_end": 91.39999999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "Last week's correction remains a memory proposal, pending Morgan's separate approval.",
      "source_start": 79.496,
      "source_end": 83.976,
      "sequence_start": 91.65599999999999,
      "sequence_end": 96.136
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The controller's route is a written rule, not a new decision maker.",
      "source_start": 84.318,
      "source_end": 87.75,
      "sequence_start": 96.478,
      "sequence_end": 99.91
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "A new teammate should be able to point to each item without asking who remembers where it went.",
      "source_start": 88.067,
      "source_end": 93.08,
      "sequence_start": 100.22699999999999,
      "sequence_end": 105.24
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "The workbook also asks where approval, spend checks, public-safe proof, and rollback sit.",
      "source_start": 93.4,
      "source_end": 99.514,
      "sequence_start": 105.56,
      "sequence_end": 111.67399999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "This classroom workflow has no spending or public export.",
      "source_start": 99.825,
      "source_end": 103.217,
      "sequence_start": 111.985,
      "sequence_end": 115.377
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "Mark those as closed paths with an owner, not as empty arrows that imply they might work.",
      "source_start": 103.495,
      "source_end": 108.657,
      "sequence_start": 115.655,
      "sequence_end": 120.817
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "Rollback here means Morgan can withdraw a draft recommendation and record why.",
      "source_start": 108.913,
      "source_end": 113.617,
      "sequence_start": 121.073,
      "sequence_end": 125.777
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "It does not undo an announcement, because no announcement happens.",
      "source_start": 113.882,
      "source_end": 117.232,
      "sequence_start": 126.042,
      "sequence_end": 129.392
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "If your own paper map has a step without a named owner or a return path, circle it.",
      "source_start": 117.552,
      "source_end": 122.202,
      "sequence_start": 129.71200000000002,
      "sequence_end": 134.362
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "That is the next design task.",
      "source_start": 122.458,
      "source_end": 124.165,
      "sequence_start": 134.618,
      "sequence_end": 136.32500000000002
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-06",
      "text": "Pause.",
      "source_start": 124.421,
      "source_end": 125.095,
      "sequence_start": 136.58100000000002,
      "sequence_end": 137.255
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-06",
      "text": "Could someone new find the current brief and its source check from this page alone?",
      "source_start": 125.47,
      "source_end": 129.545,
      "sequence_start": 137.63,
      "sequence_end": 141.70499999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-06",
      "text": "Name the first missing handoff.",
      "source_start": 129.95,
      "source_end": 131.785,
      "sequence_start": 142.10999999999999,
      "sequence_end": 143.945
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Build the Operating Map in your Operating File.",
      "source_start": 132.169,
      "source_end": 134.516,
      "sequence_start": 144.329,
      "sequence_end": 146.676
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Use a fictional or approved example.",
      "source_start": 134.814,
      "source_end": 137.001,
      "sequence_start": 146.974,
      "sequence_end": 149.161
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Do not use private operational data.",
      "source_start": 137.352,
      "source_end": 139.891,
      "sequence_start": 149.512,
      "sequence_end": 152.051
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Give every row the five columns.",
      "source_start": 140.211,
      "source_end": 142.558,
      "sequence_start": 152.371,
      "sequence_end": 154.718
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Place the job, decision, source, receipt, memory proposal, and human owner.",
      "source_start": 142.814,
      "source_end": 148.403,
      "sequence_start": 154.974,
      "sequence_end": 160.563
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Label closed paths for spending, publication, and external messages.",
      "source_start": 148.702,
      "source_end": 152.951,
      "sequence_start": 160.862,
      "sequence_end": 165.111
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Then trace one failed source check: the note is stale, the draft stops, and Morgan receives a reason.",
      "source_start": 153.232,
      "source_end": 159.824,
      "sequence_start": 165.392,
      "sequence_end": 171.984
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "We are making a design someone can review.",
      "source_start": 160.144,
      "source_end": 162.427,
      "sequence_start": 172.304,
      "sequence_end": 174.587
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-08",
      "text": "Save revision five as a draft.",
      "source_start": 162.832,
      "source_end": 164.811,
      "sequence_start": 219.99199999999996,
      "sequence_end": 221.971
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-08",
      "text": "A map earns its place when its blank cells stay visible and someone owns each repair.",
      "source_start": 165.125,
      "source_end": 170.75662131519275,
      "sequence_start": 222.28499999999997,
      "sequence_end": 227.91662131519274
    }
  ],
